    "No Cargo, compile, native resource test or gate run by this reviewer. Root's historical fa baseline is supporting evidence, not a new execution.",
    "Existing three lifecycle controls establish their actual network and destruction contracts only after fixed native execution; completed unexpected JoinError, simultaneous causes and TCP cleanup timeout are source-assessed and have no new causal controls here.",
    "Preexisting QUIC raw serving descendants and unbounded successful parent drain remain open; broad TCP TLS/head/write/shutdown/accept error classification remains unchanged and open.",
    "Count controls use synthetic counter/task state and preserve actual typed timers; they do not prove QUIC/TCP wire conformance.",
    "Final parent coverage is a full manual semantic-owner read plus a current import-only differential; no invented fresh full final read or whole-codebase promotion."
